OL,3,ACanada braces for prolonged trade war
OL,4,Aas counter-tariffs on US take effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada's retaliatory tariffs on a range
OL,7,Fof US goods came into effect on
OL,8,FTuesday, with no sign of a trade deal
OL,9,Fon the horizon.
OL,11,FThe counter-tariffs will apply to
OL,12,Fnearly C$28bn ($20bn; #15bn) worth of
OL,13,FAmerican products, from steel to
OL,14,Ffurniture to cotton T-shirts, and will
OL,15,Fbe as high as 50%.
OL,17,FFresh fish and lobster were also on the
OL,18,Flist, but Canada later omitted them
OL,19,Fafter pushback from its seafood
OL,20,Findustry - a sign of the tricky balance
OL,21,Fit has to strike as it retaliates
OL,22,Fagainst its largest trading partner.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
