OL,3,ACanada braces for prolonged trade war
OL,4,Aas counter-tariffs on US take effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth US and Canadian officials have
OL,7,Fsaid they would like to strike a deal,
OL,8,Fbut no movement has been made to resume
OL,9,Ftalks after they collapsed in late
OL,10,FAugust.
